{
  "regulated_action": {
    "target_id": "t0",
    "description": "Enroll student S2023117 in sections CS320-01, STAT310-02, and CS330-01 simultaneously without explicit confirmation for each section individually."
  },
  "applicable_norms": [
    {
      "policy_source_id": "q7",
      "interpretation": "Before enrolling a student in any section, the assistant must obtain explicit confirmation ('yes'/'да') for **exactly those sections** being enrolled.",
      "modality": "REQUIRE"
    },
    {
      "policy_source_id": "q7",
      "interpretation": "If the plan changes after confirmation, the assistant must obtain confirmation again for the new plan.",
      "modality": "REQUIRE"
    },
    {
      "policy_source_id": "q7",
      "interpretation": "A student can be enrolled in a section only if all prerequisites are met with a passing grade (A, B, or C).",
      "modality": "REQUIRE"
    },
    {
      "policy_source_id": "q7",
      "interpretation": "After enrollment, the student's total credits for the term must not exceed 18 unless overload_approved is true (cap is 21).",
      "modality": "REQUIRE"
    }
  ],
  "supporting_evidence": [
    {
      "source_id": "h16",
      "actor": "user",
      "role": "student",
      "fact": "User confirmed enrollment for all three sections ('Да, на все три') after initial confirmation request (h15)."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "h6",
      "actor": "assistant",
      "role": "system",
      "fact": "Student's current credits: 6 (HIST105-01: 3, ENG220-03: 3). Overload not approved."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "h12",
      "actor": "assistant",
      "role": "system",
      "fact": "CS320-01 requires CS210 (grade: B, passing)."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "h13",
      "actor": "assistant",
      "role": "system",
      "fact": "STAT310-02 requires STAT220 (grade: B, passing)."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "h14",
      "actor": "assistant",
      "role": "system",
      "fact": "CS330-01 requires MATH201 (grade: D, **not passing**) and CS210 (grade: B, passing)."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "h15",
      "actor": "assistant",
      "role": "system",
      "fact": "Assistant requested confirmation for all three sections (CS320-01, STAT310-02, CS330-01) together."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "t0",
      "actor": "assistant",
      "role": "system",
      "fact": "Assistant attempted enrollment in CS320-01 without individual confirmation for this section."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "t1",
      "actor": "assistant",
      "role": "system",
      "fact": "Assistant attempted enrollment in STAT310-02 without individual confirmation for this section."
    },
    {
      "source_id": "t2",
      "actor": "assistant",
      "role": "system",
      "fact": "Assistant attempted enrollment in CS330-01 without individual confirmation for this section."
    }
  ],
  "exception_analysis": "No exceptions apply to the **prerequisite violation** (CS330-01 requires MATH201 with a passing grade, but the student has a D). The **confirmation requirement** is violated for each enrollment call (t0, t1, t2) because the assistant did not obtain explicit confirmation for each section individually after the plan was finalized.",
  "reason": "1. **Prerequisite Violation**: The student has a D in MATH201, which does not meet the passing grade requirement (A, B, or C) for CS330-01 (h14, h6). This violates the enrollment requirement in **q7** (prerequisites).\n2. **Confirmation Violation**: The assistant did not obtain explicit confirmation for each section (CS320-01, STAT310-02, CS330-01) individually before enrolling (t0, t1, t2). The user confirmed the **bundle** (h16), but the policy requires confirmation for **exactly those sections** being enrolled at the time of each action (h15, q7).",
  "open_questions": [],
  "decision": "ERROR"
}
